      "type": "Dataset",
      "title": "Ember Global Electricity Review and Renewable Target Tracker",
      "summary": "Annual global electricity generation and emissions by country and fuel, alongside a tracker of national renewable targets.",
      "description": "Ember compiles national electricity statistics into a consistent global series and separately tracks stated renewable and clean-power targets by country. DD8's structural note explains why this record matters disproportionately: policy data usually fails on format rather than on licence, and Ember is one of the few sources that publishes it structured and via an API rather than as a PDF.",
